<title>UK: Merita Bank awards mandate for Finnish markka FRN.</title>
<headline>Merita Bank awards mandate for Finnish markka FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merita Bank has appointed Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and UBS to lead manage its upcoming Finnish markka three-year FRN, the lead managers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The size and pricing will be determined during the course of this week, syndicate officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;We will embark on price discovery and look at the market. We have no preconceived ideas,&quot; a Deutsche official said.</p>
<p>Merita Bank is rated A2 by Moody's Investors Service and BBB+ Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
